Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重新开始 No.狩猎。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马身上戴着的奇怪的吊坠。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：真是的完全没想到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 No.猎人快斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然会再次来袭击我……＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜想要保护皇之键的鲨鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灵魂被快斗夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到最后连皇之键都被抢走了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之键里面，有星光体在。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我，星光体现在，我就来救你！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！鲨鱼！鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作一点啊，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（雷鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）结果怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）是的目前正在解析中！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人 您为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对这条项链如此执着？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.41,0:01:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想知道真相。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr. Faker并没有说出全部。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，那就自己查个水落石出。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 快斗大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您打算瞒着Dr. Faker大人暗中行动？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴，专心解析！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）医院的医生说身体上没有任何异常。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）那为什么意识就是醒不过来啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说到底 那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）快斗是昏过去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼是被抽走了灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被抽走灵魂！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 游马到底做了什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:02:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗输了的话 那家伙就会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗会把 No.卡连同灵魂一起夺走！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那家伙把我的皇之钥拿走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里面 有星光体在！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之钥里面有一个特殊的空间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 不在我身边的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直都待在那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 鲨鱼的灵魂和
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.86,0:02:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之钥里的星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都落到了那个叫快斗的家伙手里？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只要找出快斗就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 要怎么找！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然他夺走了钥匙不是调查一下吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底用电脑去解析。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，说不定能找出皇之钥！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有这种事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这之中存在着另一个重力场！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重力场……怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，这个吊坠里面{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通往异空间是相连的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说，星光界……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能打开入口吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）散布电脑病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除此之外没有别的办法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从游马那里夺走皇之键的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会用电脑来调查那把键。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，只要黑进那个信息
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能找出来是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.67,0:03:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以老师的电脑技术轻松搞定吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那样做的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不这么做的话 鲨鱼和星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都回不来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老师 过来一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 嗯…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老师 你会做的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话 老师就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}散布了巴格曼病毒的人被大家…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候 老师把整个街区都闹得沸沸扬扬了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 那个是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 老师 快点 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个叫快斗的人的所在地一旦知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就要去那里对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 要跟他决斗对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道 星光体也好 鲨鱼也好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都必须去救。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事 别担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 绝对不会输给快斗那种家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）但是啊 委员长……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.87,0:04:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}散播电脑病毒什么的真的没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然没问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽说是病毒但并不是恶意程序。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是用来在网络中把类似皇之钥的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个不剩地找出来的程序。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是老师做的病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定能找到游马同学的皇之钥。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（BUGMAN）BUGMAN BUGMAN BUGMAN！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么老师的电脑病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是BUGMAN的样子啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和之前的BUGMAN病毒有关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和老师怎么可能有关系啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！这样病毒就改良完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 巴格曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴格曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 巴格曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行 没有反应。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 对地球上的物质{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎不会产生反应。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}试试屏障之光。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障之光。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是从巴里安的世界我们得到的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是 快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有这一手啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 关键的屏障之光呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 没有那股能量的话无法活动。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是一点点的话没问题快点。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这怎么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.55,0:07:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我珍贵的 珍贵的能量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只稍微一点点请允许我放入。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:08:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把屏障之光靠近皇之键试试。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 吊坠在共鸣。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目前 空间内质量 正在上升。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同时 重力也在变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 难道说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}门打开了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是通往星光界的入口吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么空间？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）在哪 在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漏洞漏洞漏洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漏洞 漏洞人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）有反应了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第四码头的由心园管理的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仓库的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之钥在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）找到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙就是来自星光体的使者吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 果然是你吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么知道我的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你曾经战斗过一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？那个 No.是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.的原版附身到他身上了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你夺走了皇之键吧从游马那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之键啊，那东西叫这名字吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么寻找 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你才是，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡是我记忆的碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么，你的记忆？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错所以我要回收 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你又是为了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，星光界与 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有，巴利安界的秘密为了知晓这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要将所有 No.卡回收
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须找到答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，把你的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部交出来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要把彼此的 No.全都赌上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运 开启了门扉。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《等着我吧 星光体》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 让我来狩猎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你的 No.全部……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《快斗 终于战斗的时刻到来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 不会再逃也不会再躲了》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 星光体他……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放1张 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我盖放的是 隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示时　1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以免于被战斗破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我盖下的　另一张
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是陷阱卡　战斗破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方攻击过来时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏那只怪兽并结束战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧　你要怎么攻破这个阵型？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先　让我把你的盖牌给封住吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　反转破坏者。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反转破坏者进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方会被封住魔法陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　反转破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然如我所料　是隆隆隆石人吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击破坏者的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击破坏者在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与里侧守备怪兽战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不进行伤害计算直接破坏对方。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆石人能发动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回避破坏的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有在战斗的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对于效果造成的破坏是无法使用回避效果的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且反击破坏者在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用效果破坏了里侧守备怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升５００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《攻击力２，０００。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的王牌怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的召唤条件是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击力２，０００以上的怪兽２只
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了召唤银河眼所做的铺垫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽……》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅仅凭1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的防御就崩溃了……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是了不起啊，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的决斗总是超乎我的想象。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}荣幸之至，不过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想用这种话来让我大意是没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没那个意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:14:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据我所知你是最强的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的决斗中倾注了灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是什么让你如此？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦……你还有余裕观察我居然还有这种余裕。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.69,0:14:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}硬要说的话，和你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.36,0:14:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所背负的东西不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.89,0:14:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大概就是这么回事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你收集 No.卡这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎有关系啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对即将消失的你，我没打算说这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗，真遗憾。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我被你深深吸引了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和游马一样的东西，拥有着那个的你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我曾试图附身到游马身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我能感受到他的内心。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马内心深处的东西是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去双亲的悲伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，在悲伤之中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信父母的教诲并以此活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他正在苦苦挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和那家伙一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有什么父母。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有的，只有哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:14:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊的话就别说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，是你的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤隆隆隆巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤隆隆隆石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，使用这个效果时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆巨人变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这样一来，那家伙的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4的怪兽有2只。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗，No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《问题在于快斗的盖牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是在等着我的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的陷阱吗… 唔！》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法 双重防御者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有2只表侧守备怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效对方怪兽的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！我还以为你肯定会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤你的王牌霍普呢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果召唤霍普就会变成守备表示{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆岩和隆隆巨人都消失{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算使用霍普的能力防御次数会减少。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那两张盖牌也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了防住我的攻击的卡吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在警惕我的盖牌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是说 害怕银河眼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡 光子飓风！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以按照自己手牌的数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法 陷阱卡返回手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 你的盖牌全部 返回手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错你所害怕的 我的盖牌是……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是一张魔法卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！ 为了应对你的攻击并不是能够反击的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那个回合如果你发动攻击的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个局势就会改变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将逆转破坏者解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.73,0:17:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升级召唤光子狮！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动光子狮的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咆哮冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方的手牌强制返回卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并按其数量抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，重新抽手牌吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你的战略{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都回到起点了。呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是有点失望啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你现在的战略，就是一味防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙太胆怯了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开门！开门啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.17,0:18:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开门！开门啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！卡组又！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体在战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体有危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能知道！我能感觉到！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙在战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体在和谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和 No.猎人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！开门！开门啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子长矛，装备给光子狮。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了光子长矛的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击守备怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:19:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果攻击力超过守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予对方玩家相应的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子雷欧 攻击隆隆岩巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我 在不知不觉中感到害怕了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去 是赢不了快斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.67,0:19:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来我忘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最重要的事》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶—— 明明都走到这一步了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果 我连星光体和小鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都救不了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你给我振作一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是倒下了那该怎么办啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说、说得也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能救星光体的只有我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我开！唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.96,0:20:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我开！快给我开啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快开！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我开！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}门开了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才我把病毒送进了那里的安保系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:20:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}趁现在快进去。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:21:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了，右京老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，快斗大人，快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果您没事的话请您回应一声。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虫人，虫人，虫人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇，哎！？怎、怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，不得了了不得了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（警报声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第三区域发现入侵者。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙是什么人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎怎怎、怎么办啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种时候要是搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的会被报废掉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙身手不差。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，这场决斗你还是放弃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想赢我你的内心太脆弱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，我不会放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，如果是以前的我，早就放弃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，现在我不会放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.33,0:22:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我从重要的朋友那里学会了什么叫一飞冲天。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家已经投票了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.93,0:22:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被选为第一名的 No.是？

